      "message": "I was also looking for some other way but couldn\u0027t find any. Location provider is defined [here](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:frameworks/base/location/lib/Android.bp;l\u003d27;drc\u003dfe09091214c715856ecae3c3daf9836238ee3cbe). I don\u0027t see anything special in it that can differentiate it from other SDK libraries.\n\nUlya, do you know any other way?",
