      "writtenOn": "2022-11-29T11:57:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the explanation, Ulya. Here, we only care about the uses-library cases because those are what we intend to support with dexpreopt. You made a good point that this code runs before all the modules have been processed. Given that, I don\u0027t see a good way to differentiate location provider from those only used by the system server. I\u0027ll keep this ugly approach then.",
